---
/**
 * Engineering process (Steps S3.29–S3.43)
 * Section shell, heading block, desktop timeline, and mobile milestone stack.
 */
---

<section class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface-container-lowest">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
        Methodical Rigor
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-md sm:text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">
        Our Engineering &amp; Delivery Process
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-secondary mt-2">
        From schematic conception to live energization, our six-phase methodology ensures zero regulatory surprises, complete safety compliance, and robust lifecycle performance.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- Desktop Process Flow (Horizontal Chain) -->
    <div class="hidden lg:grid lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 relative">
      <!-- Connecting Line Background -->
      <div class="absolute top-7 left-8 right-8 h-0.5 bg-surface-container -z-0"></div>
      <!-- Step 01 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-primary text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline-sm shadow-sm">
          01
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-bold">Understand Requirements</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            In-depth operational requirement intake, load audit, utility liaison, and specification review.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Step 02 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-surface-variant text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center font-headline-sm shadow-sm">
          02
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-bold">Site Assessment</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            On-site spatial feasibility, architectural layout verification, soil resistivity surveys, and structural checks.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Step 03 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-surface-variant text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center font-headline-sm shadow-sm">
          03
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-bold">Planning &amp; Design</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Detailed single line diagrams (SLD), CAD cable routing schemes, load calculations, and bill of quantities.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Step 04 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-surface-variant text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center font-headline-sm shadow-sm">
          04
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-bold">Installation</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Precise on-site assembly, tray mounting, conduit pulling, switchboard positioning, and terminations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Step 05 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-primary text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-headline-sm shadow-sm">
          05
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-bold">Testing &amp; Commissioning</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Megger resistance, earth fault impedance, thermal scans, protective relay calibration, and live signoff.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Step 06 -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest border-2 border-surface-variant text-on-surface flex items-center justify-center font-headline-sm shadow-sm">
          06
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface font-bold">Handover &amp; Support</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Complete as-built drawing delivery, client team operational training, warranty activation, and 24/7 SLA.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Mobile Process Flow (Vertical Milestones) -->
    <div class="flex flex-col space-y-6 lg:hidden">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
